Third-Party Licenses

This sample does not vendor (bundle) third-party source code in a modified form.
The dependencies below are fetched at build time (by pip for the agent
container, by npm for the dashboard) and the container base image is pulled from
the public Amazon ECR mirror. They are listed here for transparency and
attribution. Versions reflect the pinned values in the sources noted; consumers
who adapt this sample should confirm current versions and licenses.

