Dashboard, JavaScript (assets/dashboard/package.json)
-----------------------------------------------------
The dashboard is a Create React App project. Its dependencies (including react
and react-dom, MIT; react-scripts, MIT; and their transitive dependencies) are
resolved and fetched by npm at build time per package.json and
package-lock.json. Refer to those files and each package's repository for the
authoritative license of every transitive dependency.

Container base image (assets/agent/Dockerfile)
-----------------------------------------------
python:3.12-slim (pulled from public.ecr.aws/docker/library/python)
  Python interpreter: PSF License
  Debian base OS packages: various (predominantly GPL, LGPL, and permissive
